        {
          "text": "Ndizi mapenzi aako mbwaabede, abucete bwako (nekubaboobo uli muvubi), alimwi ndizi busanke bwabaabo balyaamba kuti mba-Juda, anukuti tabali ba-Juda, bali imbungano ya-Saatani, ",
