        {
          "text": "Ndizi nkokala, nkukuti nkukonya nkucibede cuuno ca-Sataani, alimwi nduwe uujatisya izina lyangu, tokokatama lusyomo lwangu, nikuba kumazuba aa-Antipa kamboni wangu musyomesi, iwakajayigwa akati kanu nkwakala Saatani. ",
