        },
        {
          "text": "Pele nywebo nobamwi nomusyeede mu-Tuataira, nomutajisi lwiiyo olu akutana kuziba makani malamfu aabulondo bwa-Saatani, mbuli mbobaamba, ndamwaambila obu. Nsikooyoomubikila mukuli umbi. ",
